    <statement><p>Find the equation of the solution to 
<m>\displaystyle \frac{dy}{dx} = x^{3} y</m>
through the point <m>(x,y) = (1,4)</m>.</p>
<p><fillin characters="30" name="AnSwEr0001"/></p>
</statement>
    <answer>
      <p>
        <m>y = \frac{4}{e^{\frac{1}{4}}}e^{\frac{x^{4}}{4}}</m>
      </p>
    </answer>
